stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_order: order a, b so len(a) >= len(b)
    q_order --> q_iter: i = 0
    q_iter --> q_add: i < len(a)
    q_iter --> q_return: i >= len(a)
    q_add --> q_iter: result[i] = a[i] + (b[i] if i < len(b) else 0)
    q_return --> [*]: return PolynomialCoeff(result)
